/visual-recap

Review PR ${1:https://github.com/org/repo/pull/pr_number} and produce a visual recap of the changes.

- Read the PR (gh pr view/diff) and the real files/symbols it touches; ground
  the recap in the actual diff, not assumptions.
- This is review only — do NOT edit any source. The deliverable is the recap.
- Use local-files privacy mode (no hosted DB writes). Author it under
  .agent-native/recaps/<slug>/ with kind: "recap" and localOnly: true, and lint
  with \`plan local check\`.
- At the end, START the local bridge as a detached background process
  (\`plan local serve --kind recap\`) and OPEN the rendered recap in Chrome, then
  give me the live URL. Keep the bridge running until I say stop.
- Put review concerns, risks, and anything needing a decision in focused review
  notes with a recommended default for each.
